{"title":"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 86","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_86&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc6d9a6172d35127b6cb37ea92192caf7029a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be positive real numbers such that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/6/6261896ca8bda4b7cd9f07447991fe1a9e5e037a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{array}{c@{\\hspace{3pt}}c@{\\hspace{3pt}}c@{\\hspace{3pt}}c@{\\hspace{3pt}}c}a^2+b^2&amp;=&amp;c^2+d^2&amp;=&amp;2008,\\\\ ac&amp;=&amp;bd&amp;=&amp;1000.\\end{array}\\]\" width=\"197\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/8/718275fb26bfc65d0bd6ffd8ed796faa2d57393c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=a+b+c+d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"138\" height=\"14\" />, compute the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/f/e3f845944fd516023c47bdd58ede2ae71a946b10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor S\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"25\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_86&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/c/aac55f70a75c4e385d78e452d00dfb03c5c26a93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = \\tfrac{1000}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"64\" height=\"23\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/a/a6a6430ccbe1e11f39740be7978ead0147b8f0c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = \\tfrac{1000}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"66\" height=\"23\" />. Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/2/132fe322bf0b3a7c1e09c9c2cdefd4ddcaa8b82b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1000000}{a^2} + \\frac{1000000}{b^2} = \\frac{1000000(a^2 + b^2)}{a^2 b^2} = 2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"377\" height=\"39\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/b/c7bcac08bad7cff5f20b775edbe4a6fc935dad52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2 = 2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/e/c2e97b09214440d2ec7a17fcb523e0ba8698d136.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 b^2 = 1000000$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"119\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/e/e3e6fec7915a598537112b590b40f44bb4265d9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"77\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/a/3fa98c38946eb3d23fc3416d0ff6f4a57adc29be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + 2ab + b^2 = 4008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"163\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/5/9750edf893a7ecf4037dc900b65ea7bd328c9e14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = \\sqrt{4008} = 2\\sqrt{1002}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"200\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nNote that if we solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and substitute, we can use the same steps to show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/8/4580fbd5a2c7b74c0c6a9364fc231e08c993178c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c+d = 2\\sqrt{1002}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/f/40f367668b5eb0f5b6efb9911ca40d5878228bd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = 4\\sqrt{1002} \\approx 126.62$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"171\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/1/531b3d037de71fb4470b48aecb93e4015819ef8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor S\\rfloor = \\boxed{126}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"93\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_86&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest\" title=\"2008 iTest\">2008 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n